        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI think the proper way is to add some kind of `source` field to [notification specification](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/df1559e2ed7ece458e0a97a8bb9556d465d1c775/doc/mini-notify.txt#L61). One small issue is that [`add()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/df1559e2ed7ece458e0a97a8bb9556d465d1c775/doc/mini-notify.txt#L263) was not really designed to be extensible (mostly by design to limit complexity). I'd take some time to think if adding `source` as fourth argument is worth it.",
