        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be cleanly possible on latest `main` through new [`data` field of notifications](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a354c754656538ad76d1add93ca21e75b7f3181/doc/mini-notify.txt#L71). All notifications from built-in LSP progress handler set [the following fields in `data`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a354c754656538ad76d1add93ca21e75b7f3181/doc/mini-notify.txt#L203-L207), which includes `source`. Here is [an example of how to write `content.format` that behaves differently for notifications from LSP progress](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3a354c754656538ad76d1add93ca21e75b7f3181/doc/mini-notify.txt#L161-L165).",
