        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@echasnovski Thank you, I have changed the function to the snippet below which works perfectly! 🥳\n\n```lua\ncontent = {\n    format = function (notification)\n        if notification.data.source == 'lsp_progress' then\n            local s_pos, e_pos = string.find(notification.msg, notification.data.client_name .. ': ', 1, true)\n\n            if s_pos ~= nil and e_pos ~= nil then\n                return string.sub(notification.msg, e_pos + 1)\n            end\n        end\n\n        return notification.msg\n    end,\n}\n```",
            "created_at": "2025-02-28T16:20:49Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1275#issuecomment-2691054477",
